{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"He turns to Willow\nThe ring of warmth is on the desk next to his studio","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:36:13.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869664497365815366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"It's not your time to die. You can make it out successful. I have full faith in you\" he says","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:37:15.476000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869664756234063894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I hope so. But if I die down there... thats it. No second chances. I'll be gone forever.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:37:48.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869664896244154398","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"Oh, I uh... meant to give this to you when we were still together... I suppose now's a good time as any.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:39:13.893000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869665252910964756","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"You have the best people at your side for this job. And let me say, when I have full faith in you, I don't mean that lightly. I don't believe the gods are doing anything for us, so I choose to put my faith in the people around me. And you are an extraordinary person\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:39:14.207000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869665254228000778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"Willow takes out the red, white, and blue silk robe.","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:39:26.995000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869665307864735845","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"He takes it carefully looking it over with care and endearment","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:39:56.143000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869665430120312902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I'll love you forever Finn. Even if we're not together, I want the best for you. So, if I don't make it out... just... move on... find someone worth your love...\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:41:13.645000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869665755187249263","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"Hey, even then, I am still expecting to see you in the morning. Both successful. And in the future if it still doesn't work out, let yourself live for the future. I may be your first love in this city, but I don't have to be your last if it doesn't work out that way\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:42:48.533000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869666153176367215","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I care greatly about you and always will hold you in high respect\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:43:12.347000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869666253059555340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"Actually. Is Niflheim a warm place or a cold one? The ring might help you, and I would prefer it get great mileage with someone I care for\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:44:14.845000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869666515195158589","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"He picks it up and brings it to Willow","created_at":"2021-07-27T19:44:22.721000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869666548229488640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
